    "Import failed": ["Türkçe": "İçe aktarma başarısız", "English": "Import failed", "Deutsch": "Import fehlgeschlagen", "Français": "Échec de l’import", "Italiano": "Import fallito", "Español (Spanish)": "Importación fallida", "Português": "Falha na importação", "Русский (Russian)": "Ошибка импорта", "日本語 (Japanese)": "インポート失敗", "中文 (Chinese)": "导入失败", "العربية (Arabic)": "فشل الاستيراد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आयात विफल"],
    "This file could not be imported. Please choose a valid NivaDesk backup JSON file.": ["Türkçe": "Bu dosya içe aktarılamadı. Lütfen geçerli bir NivaDesk yedek JSON dosyası seçin.", "English": "This file could not be imported. Please choose a valid NivaDesk backup JSON file.", "Deutsch": "Diese Datei konnte nicht importiert werden. Bitte wählen Sie eine gültige NivaDesk-JSON-Backup-Datei.", "Français": "Ce fichier n’a pas pu être importé. Choisissez un fichier JSON de sauvegarde NivaDesk valide.", "Italiano": "Questo file non può essere importato. Scegli un backup JSON NivaDesk valido.", "Español (Spanish)": "No se pudo importar este archivo. Elige un JSON de copia de NivaDesk válido.", "Português": "Não foi possível importar este arquivo. Escolha um JSON de backup NivaDesk válido.", "Русский (Russian)": "Не удалось импортировать файл. Выберите действительный JSON-файл резервной копии NivaDesk.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このファイルはインポートできません。有効なNivaDeskバックアップJSONを選択してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "无法导入此文件。请选择有效的 NivaDesk 备份 JSON 文件。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تعذر استيراد هذا الملف. اختر ملف JSON احتياطي صالح لـ NivaDesk.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह फ़ाइल आयात नहीं हो सकी। कृपया मान्य NivaDesk बैकअप JSON चुनें."],
    "Profile updated.": ["Türkçe": "Profil güncellendi.", "English": "Profile updated.", "Deutsch": "Profil aktualisiert.", "Français": "Profil mis à jour.", "Italiano": "Profilo aggiornato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Perfil actualizado.", "Português": "Perfil atualizado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Профиль обновлен.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "プロフィール更新済み。", "中文 (Chinese)": "资料已更新。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تحديث الملف.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "प्रोफ़ाइल अपडेट हुई."],
    "Profile updated. Company details can only be changed by the workspace owner.": ["Türkçe": "Profil güncellendi. Şirket bilgilerini sadece workspace sahibi değiştirebilir.", "English": "Profile updated. Company details can only be changed by the workspace owner.", "Deutsch": "Profil aktualisiert. Unternehmensdetails kann nur der Besitzer ändern.", "Français": "Profil mis à jour. Seul le propriétaire peut modifier l’entreprise.", "Italiano": "Profilo aggiornato. Solo il proprietario può cambiare l’azienda.", "Español (Spanish)": "Perfil actualizado. Solo el propietario puede cambiar la empresa.", "Português": "Perfil atualizado. Só o proprietário pode alterar a empresa.", "Русский (Russian)": "Профиль обновлен. Данные компании может менять только владелец.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "プロフィールを更新しました。会社情報はオーナーのみ変更できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "资料已更新。公司信息仅所有者可更改。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تحديث الملف. لا يغيّر بيانات الشركة إلا المالك.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "प्रोफ़ाइल अपडेट हुई। कंपनी विवरण केवल owner बदल सकता है."],
    "Password reset email sent to": ["Türkçe": "Şifre sıfırlama e-postası gönderildi:", "English": "Password reset email sent to", "Deutsch": "Passwort-E-Mail gesendet an", "Français": "E-mail de réinitialisation envoyé à", "Italiano": "Email reset inviata a", "Español (Spanish)": "Email de restablecimiento enviado a", "Português": "Email de redefinição enviado para", "Русский (Russian)": "Письмо сброса отправлено на", "日本語 (Japanese)": "再設定メール送信先", "中文 (Chinese)": "密码重置邮件已发送至", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إرسال بريد إعادة التعيين إلى", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "पासवर्ड रीसेट ईमेल भेजा गया"],
    "Team member added. They will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces after refreshing.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip üyesi eklendi. Yeniledikten sonra bu workspace’i görecek.", "English": "Team member added. They will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces after refreshing.", "Deutsch": "Teammitglied hinzugefügt. Nach Aktualisierung sieht es diesen Arbeitsbereich.", "Français": "Membre ajouté. Il verra cet espace après actualisation.", "Italiano": "Membro aggiunto. Vedrà il workspace dopo aggiornamento.", "Español (Spanish)": "Miembro añadido. Verá el espacio tras actualizar.", "Português": "Membro adicionado. Verá o workspace após atualizar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Участник добавлен. Он увидит область после обновления.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "メンバーを追加しました。更新後に表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "成员已添加，刷新后可看到该工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت إضافة العضو. سيظهر له بعد التحديث.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सदस्य जोड़ा गया। रीफ़्रेश के बाद वर्कस्पेस दिखेगा."],
    "Team role updated.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip rolü güncellendi.", "English": "Team role updated.", "Deutsch": "Teamrolle aktualisiert.", "Français": "Rôle mis à jour.", "Italiano": "Ruolo aggiornato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Rol actualizado.", "Português": "Função atualizada.", "Русский (Russian)": "Роль обновлена.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ロールを更新しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "角色已更新。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم تحديث الدور.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "भूमिका अपडेट हुई."],
    "Team member removed.": ["Türkçe": "Ekip üyesi kaldırıldı.", "English": "Team member removed.", "Deutsch": "Teammitglied entfernt.", "Français": "Membre supprimé.", "Italiano": "Membro rimosso.", "Español (Spanish)": "Miembro eliminado.", "Português": "Membro removido.", "Русский (Russian)": "Участник удален.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "メンバーを削除しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "成员已移除。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت إزالة العضو.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सदस्य हटाया गया."],
    "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from Team Access.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği gönderildi. Workspace sahibi Team Access ekranından onaylayabilir.", "English": "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from Team Access.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage gesendet. Der Besitzer kann sie unter Team Access genehmigen.", "Français": "Demande envoyée. Le propriétaire peut l’approuver depuis Team Access.", "Italiano": "Richiesta inviata. Il proprietario può approvarla da Team Access.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud enviada. El propietario puede aprobarla desde Team Access.", "Português": "Pedido enviado. O proprietário pode aprovar em Team Access.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос отправлен. Владелец может одобрить его в Team Access.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "リクエストを送信しました。オーナーは Team Access から承認できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "访问请求已发送。所有者可在 Team Access 中批准。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إرسال طلب الوصول. يمكن للمالك الموافقة عليه من Team Access.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "एक्सेस अनुरोध भेजा गया। Workspace owner इसे Team Access से approve कर सकता है."],
    "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from their Account screen.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği gönderildi. Workspace sahibi Account ekranından onaylayabilir.", "English": "Access request sent. The workspace owner can approve it from their Account screen.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage gesendet. Der Besitzer kann sie im Konto genehmigen.", "Français": "Demande envoyée. Le propriétaire peut l’approuver depuis Compte.", "Italiano": "Richiesta inviata. Il proprietario può approvarla dall’account.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud enviada. El propietario puede aprobarla en Cuenta.", "Português": "Pedido enviado. O proprietário pode aprovar na Conta.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос отправлен. Владелец может одобрить в аккаунте.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "リクエスト送信済み。オーナーがアカウント画面で承認できます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请求已发送。所有者可在账户页批准。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم إرسال الطلب. يمكن للمالك الموافقة من الحساب.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुरोध भेजा गया। Owner Account स्क्रीन से मंज़ूर कर सकता है."],
    "Access request approved. The user will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği onaylandı. Kullanıcı bu workspace’i Available Workspaces içinde görecek.", "English": "Access request approved. The user will now see this workspace in Available Workspaces.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage genehmigt. Der Benutzer sieht den Arbeitsbereich.", "Français": "Demande approuvée. L’utilisateur verra cet espace.", "Italiano": "Richiesta approvata. L’utente vedrà questo workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud aprobada. El usuario verá este espacio.", "Português": "Pedido aprovado. O usuário verá este workspace.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос одобрен. Пользователь увидит область.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "承認済み。ユーザーに表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请求已批准，用户会看到该工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تمت الموافقة وسيظهر للمستخدم.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुरोध स्वीकृत। उपयोगकर्ता वर्कस्पेस देखेगा."],
    "Access request declined.": ["Türkçe": "Erişim isteği reddedildi.", "English": "Access request declined.", "Deutsch": "Anfrage abgelehnt.", "Français": "Demande refusée.", "Italiano": "Richiesta rifiutata.", "Español (Spanish)": "Solicitud rechazada.", "Português": "Pedido recusado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Запрос отклонен.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "リクエストを拒否しました。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请求已拒绝。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تم رفض الطلب.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुरोध अस्वीकृत."],
    "This workspace is workflow-only for your account. You can follow order progress, but prices, dashboard and editing tools are hidden.": ["Türkçe": "Bu workspace hesabınız için sadece iş akışı modunda. Sipariş ilerlemesini görebilirsiniz; fiyatlar, dashboard ve düzenleme araçları gizlidir.", "English": "This workspace is workflow-only for your account. You can follow order progress, but prices, dashboard and editing tools are hidden.", "Deutsch": "Dieser Arbeitsbereich ist nur für Workflow. Preise, Dashboard und Bearbeitung sind ausgeblendet.", "Français": "Cet espace est limité au flux. Prix, tableau de bord et édition sont masqués.", "Italiano": "Questo workspace è solo workflow. Prezzi, dashboard e modifica sono nascosti.", "Español (Spanish)": "Este espacio es solo flujo. Precios, panel y edición están ocultos.", "Português": "Este workspace é apenas workflow. Preços, painel e edição ficam ocultos.", "Русский (Russian)": "Эта область только для процесса. Цены, панель и редактирование скрыты.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースは進行確認のみです。価格、ダッシュボード、編集は非表示です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此工作区仅用于流程查看，价格、仪表板和编辑工具已隐藏。", "العربية (Arabic)": "هذه المساحة لسير العمل فقط. الأسعار واللوحة وأدوات التحرير مخفية.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह वर्कस्पेस केवल वर्कफ़्लो के लिए है। कीमतें, डैशबोर्ड और संपादन छिपे हैं."],
    "This workspace is view-only for your account. You can review orders and customer information, but saving changes may be blocked by the workspace permissions.": ["Türkçe": "Bu workspace hesabınız için sadece görüntüleme modunda. Sipariş ve müşteri bilgilerini görebilirsiniz; değişiklik kaydı izinlerle engellenebilir.", "English": "This workspace is view-only for your account. You can review orders and customer information, but saving changes may be blocked by the workspace permissions.", "Deutsch": "Dieser Arbeitsbereich ist nur zum Ansehen. Speichern kann blockiert sein.", "Français": "Cet espace est en lecture seule. L’enregistrement peut être bloqué.", "Italiano": "Questo workspace è in sola lettura. Il salvataggio può essere bloccato.", "Español (Spanish)": "Este espacio es de solo lectura. Guardar puede estar bloqueado.", "Português": "Este workspace é só visualização. Salvar pode ser bloqueado.", "Русский (Russian)": "Эта область только для просмотра. Сохранение может быть заблокировано.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースは閲覧専用です。保存は権限で制限されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此工作区为仅查看，保存可能被权限阻止。", "العربية (Arabic)": "هذه المساحة للعرض فقط. قد يتم منع الحفظ.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह वर्कस्पेस केवल देखने के लिए है। सेव करना अनुमति से रुक सकता है."],
    "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.": ["Türkçe": "İlk siparişinizi oluşturun veya NivaDesk’un iş akışı adımları, alanlar ve etiketleri hazırlaması için iş kurulumunu tekrar çalıştırın.", "English": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Deutsch": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Français": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Italiano": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Español (Spanish)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Português": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "Русский (Russian)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Create your first order, or run the business setup again if you want NivaDesk to prepare workflow steps, fields and labels for you."],
    "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.": ["Türkçe": "Önce işletme türünüzü seçin. NivaDesk ilk siparişten önce iş akışı adımları, alanlar, kart etiketleri ve durumları hazırlayabilir.", "English": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Deutsch": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Français": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Italiano": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Español (Spanish)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Português": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "Русский (Russian)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "العربية (Arabic)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Choose your business type first. NivaDesk can then prepare useful workflow steps, fields, card labels and statuses before you create your first order."],
    "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.": ["Türkçe": "İşinizin nasıl ilerlediğini, müşteriden hangi bilgileri aldığınızı, onay, malzeme, randevu, depozito, kargo veya teslimat adımlarını yazabilirsiniz. Boş bırakırsanız seçili işletme türünün standart şablonu kullanılır.", "English": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Deutsch": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Français": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Italiano": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Español (Spanish)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Português": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "Русский (Russian)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "中文 (Chinese)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "العربية (Arabic)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "You can describe how your work flows, what information you collect from customers, approvals, materials, appointments, deposits, shipping or delivery. If you leave this empty, NivaDesk will use the standard template for the selected business type."],
    "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.": ["Türkçe": "Örnek: Kişiye özel boyalı saat kadranları yapıyoruz. Saat modeli, kadran ölçüsü, tema, müşteri onayı, depozito, boyama, kuruma, final fotoğraflar ve kargo gerekiyor.", "English": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Deutsch": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Français": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Italiano": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Español (Spanish)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Português": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "Русский (Russian)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, deposit, painting stage, curing, final photos and shipping.", "中文 (Chinese)": "Example: We create custom painted watch dials. We need watch model, dial size, artwork theme, client approval, dep