    "Connect WooCommerce": ["Türkçe": "WooCommerce Bağlantısı", "English": "Connect WooCommerce", "Deutsch": "WooCommerce verbinden", "Français": "Connecter WooCommerce", "Italiano": "Collega WooCommerce", "Español (Spanish)": "Conectar WooCommerce", "Português": "Ligar WooCommerce", "Русский (Russian)": "Подключить WooCommerce", "日本語 (Japanese)": "WooCommerceを接続", "中文 (Chinese)": "连接 WooCommerce", "العربية (Arabic)": "ربط WooCommerce", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "WooCommerce जोड़ें"],
    "This setup only needs to be done once in WooCommerce.": ["Türkçe": "Bu kurulum WooCommerce içinde sadece bir kez yapılır.", "English": "This setup only needs to be done once in WooCommerce.", "Deutsch": "Diese Einrichtung muss nur einmal in WooCommerce erfolgen.", "Français": "Cette configuration ne doit être faite qu’une seule fois dans WooCommerce.", "Italiano": "Questa configurazione va fatta una sola volta in WooCommerce.", "Español (Spanish)": "Esta configuración solo debe hacerse una vez en WooCommerce.", "Português": "Esta configuração só precisa de ser feita uma vez no WooCommerce.", "Русский (Russian)": "Эту настройку нужно выполнить в WooCommerce только один раз.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "この設定はWooCommerceで一度だけ行えば十分です。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此设置只需在 WooCommerce 中完成一次。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يلزم إجراء هذا الإعداد مرة واحدة فقط داخل WooCommerce.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह सेटअप WooCommerce में सिर्फ एक बार करना होगा."],
    "To activate this connection, create one WooCommerce webhook and paste the Delivery URL below. After that, new website orders will appear in this workspace automatically.": ["Türkçe": "Bu bağlantıyı aktif etmek için WooCommerce içinde bir webhook oluşturup aşağıdaki Delivery URL adresini yapıştırın. Sonrasında yeni web sitesi siparişleri bu workspace içinde otomatik görünür.", "English": "To activate this connection, create one WooCommerce webhook and paste the Delivery URL below. After that, new website orders will appear in this workspace automatically.", "Deutsch": "Um diese Verbindung zu aktivieren, erstellen Sie einen WooCommerce-Webhook und fügen Sie die Delivery URL unten ein. Danach erscheinen neue Website-Bestellungen automatisch in diesem Workspace.", "Français": "Pour activer cette connexion, créez un webhook WooCommerce et collez la Delivery URL ci-dessous. Ensuite, les nouvelles commandes du site apparaîtront automatiquement dans cet espace.", "Italiano": "Per attivare la connessione, crea un webhook WooCommerce e incolla la Delivery URL qui sotto. Poi i nuovi ordini del sito appariranno automaticamente in questo workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "Para activar esta conexión, crea un webhook de WooCommerce y pega la Delivery URL de abajo. Después, los nuevos pedidos web aparecerán automáticamente en este espacio.", "Português": "Para ativar esta ligação, crie um webhook WooCommerce e cole a Delivery URL abaixo. Depois, as novas encomendas do site aparecem automaticamente neste workspace.", "Русский (Russian)": "Чтобы активировать подключение, создайте webhook WooCommerce и вставьте Delivery URL ниже. После этого новые заказы сайта будут автоматически появляться в этом рабочем пространстве.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "この接続を有効にするには、WooCommerceでwebhookを1つ作成し、下のDelivery URLを貼り付けます。その後、新しいサイト注文がこのワークスペースに自動表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "要启用此连接，请在 WooCommerce 中创建一个 webhook，并粘贴下面的 Delivery URL。之后，新的网站订单会自动出现在此工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "لتفعيل هذا الاتصال، أنشئ webhook واحداً في WooCommerce والصق Delivery URL أدناه. بعد ذلك ستظهر طلبات الموقع الجديدة تلقائياً داخل مساحة العمل هذه.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस कनेक्शन को सक्रिय करने के लिए WooCommerce में एक webhook बनाएं और नीचे वाला Delivery URL पेस्ट करें। इसके बाद नए वेबसाइट ऑर्डर इस workspace में अपने आप दिखेंगे."],
    "Company ID is not available yet. Sign in or reconnect your workspace first.": ["Türkçe": "Company ID henüz hazır değil. Önce giriş yapın veya workspace bağlantısını tekrar kurun.", "English": "Company ID is not available yet. Sign in or reconnect your workspace first.", "Deutsch": "Die Company ID ist noch nicht verfügbar. Melden Sie sich zuerst an oder verbinden Sie den Workspace erneut.", "Français": "Le Company ID n’est pas encore disponible. Connectez-vous ou reconnectez d’abord votre espace.", "Italiano": "Il Company ID non è ancora disponibile. Accedi o ricollega prima il workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "El Company ID aún no está disponible. Inicia sesión o vuelve a conectar el espacio primero.", "Português": "O Company ID ainda não está disponível. Inicie sessão ou volte a ligar o workspace primeiro.", "Русский (Russian)": "Company ID пока недоступен. Сначала войдите или переподключите рабочее пространство.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Company IDはまだ利用できません。先にログインするかワークスペースを再接続してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "Company ID 尚不可用。请先登录或重新连接工作区。", "العربية (Arabic)": "معرّف الشركة غير متاح بعد. سجّل الدخول أو أعد ربط مساحة العمل أولاً.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Company ID अभी उपलब्ध नहीं है। पहले साइन इन करें या workspace फिर से जोड़ें."],
    "Copy Setup Details": ["Türkçe": "Kurulum Bilgilerini Kopyala", "English": "Copy Setup Details", "Deutsch": "Einrichtungsdaten kopieren", "Français": "Copier les informations de configuration", "Italiano": "Copia dettagli di configurazione", "Español (Spanish)": "Copiar datos de configuración", "Português": "Copiar dados de configuração", "Русский (Russian)": "Скопировать данные настройки", "日本語 (Japanese)": "設定情報をコピー", "中文 (Chinese)": "复制设置详情", "العربية (Arabic)": "نسخ تفاصيل الإعداد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सेटअप विवरण कॉपी करें"],
    "Your Company ID": ["Türkçe": "Company ID’niz", "English": "Your Company ID", "Deutsch": "Ihre Company ID", "Français": "Votre Company ID", "Italiano": "Il tuo Company ID", "Español (Spanish)": "Tu Company ID", "Português": "O seu Company ID", "Русский (Russian)": "Ваш Company ID", "日本語 (Japanese)": "あなたのCompany ID", "中文 (Chinese)": "您的 Company ID", "العربية (Arabic)": "معرّف شركتك", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपका Company ID"],
    "Delivery URL with Company ID": ["Türkçe": "Company ID eklenmiş Delivery URL", "English": "Delivery URL with Company ID", "Deutsch": "Delivery URL mit Company ID", "Français": "Delivery URL avec Company ID", "Italiano": "Delivery URL con Company ID", "Español (Spanish)": "Delivery URL con Company ID", "Português": "Delivery URL com Company ID", "Русский (Russian)": "Delivery URL с Company ID", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Company ID付きDelivery URL", "中文 (Chinese)": "带 Company ID 的 Delivery URL", "العربية (Arabic)": "رابط Delivery URL مع معرّف الشركة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Company ID वाला Delivery URL"],
    "Copy Company ID": ["Türkçe": "Company ID Kopyala", "English": "Copy Company ID", "Deutsch": "Company ID kopieren", "Français": "Copier le Company ID", "Italiano": "Copia Company ID", "Español (Spanish)": "Copiar Company ID", "Português": "Copiar Company ID", "Русский (Russian)": "Скопировать Company ID", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Company IDをコピー", "中文 (Chinese)": "复制 Company ID", "العربية (Arabic)": "نسخ معرّف الشركة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Company ID कॉपी करें"],
    "Copy Delivery URL": ["Türkçe": "Delivery URL Kopyala", "English": "Copy Delivery URL", "Deutsch": "Delivery URL kopieren", "Français": "Copier la Delivery URL", "Italiano": "Copia Delivery URL", "Español (Spanish)": "Copiar Delivery URL", "Português": "Copiar Delivery URL", "Русский (Russian)": "Скопировать Delivery URL", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Delivery URLをコピー", "中文 (Chinese)": "复制 Delivery URL", "العربية (Arabic)": "نسخ Delivery URL", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Delivery URL कॉपी करें"],
    "What you need to do": ["Türkçe": "Yapmanız gerekenler", "English": "What you need to do", "Deutsch": "Was Sie tun müssen", "Français": "Ce que vous devez faire", "Italiano": "Cosa devi fare", "Español (Spanish)": "Qué tienes que hacer", "Português": "O que precisa de fazer", "Русский (Russian)": "Что нужно сделать", "日本語 (Japanese)": "必要な操作", "中文 (Chinese)": "您需要做什么", "العربية (Arabic)": "ما الذي عليك فعله", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "आपको क्या करना है"],
    "Open WooCommerce webhooks": ["Türkçe": "WooCommerce webhooks ekranını açın", "English": "Open WooCommerce webhooks", "Deutsch": "WooCommerce-Webhooks öffnen", "Français": "Ouvrir les webhooks WooCommerce", "Italiano": "Apri i webhook WooCommerce", "Español (Spanish)": "Abrir webhooks de WooCommerce", "Português": "Abrir webhooks do WooCommerce", "Русский (Russian)": "Откройте webhooks WooCommerce", "日本語 (Japanese)": "WooCommerce webhooksを開く", "中文 (Chinese)": "打开 WooCommerce webhooks", "العربية (Arabic)": "افتح webhooks في WooCommerce", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "WooCommerce webhooks खोलें"],
    "In WordPress, open WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.": ["Türkçe": "WordPress içinde WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks bölümünü açın.", "English": "In WordPress, open WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "Deutsch": "Öffnen Sie in WordPress WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "Français": "Dans WordPress, ouvrez WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "Italiano": "In WordPress apri WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "Español (Spanish)": "En WordPress, abre WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "Português": "No WordPress, abra WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "Русский (Russian)": "В WordPress откройте WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "WordPressで WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks を開きます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "在 WordPress 中打开 WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks。", "العربية (Arabic)": "في WordPress افتح WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "WordPress में WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks खोलें."],
    "Create a new webhook": ["Türkçe": "Yeni webhook oluşturun", "English": "Create a new webhook", "Deutsch": "Neuen Webhook erstellen", "Français": "Créer un nouveau webhook", "Italiano": "Crea un nuovo webhook", "Español (Spanish)": "Crear un nuevo webhook", "Português": "Criar um novo webhook", "Русский (Russian)": "Создайте новый webhook", "日本語 (Japanese)": "新しいwebhookを作成", "中文 (Chinese)": "创建新的 webhook", "العربية (Arabic)": "أنشئ webhook جديداً", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "नया webhook बनाएं"],
    "Create a new webhook for NivaDesk orders.": ["Türkçe": "NivaDesk siparişleri için yeni bir webhook oluşturun.", "English": "Create a new webhook for NivaDesk orders.", "Deutsch": "Erstellen Sie einen neuen Webhook für NivaDesk-Bestellungen.", "Français": "Créez un nouveau webhook pour les commandes NivaDesk.", "Italiano": "Crea un nuovo webhook per gli ordini NivaDesk.", "Español (Spanish)": "Crea un nuevo webhook para pedidos de NivaDesk.", "Português": "Crie um novo webhook para encomendas NivaDesk.", "Русский (Russian)": "Создайте новый webhook для заказов NivaDesk.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "NivaDesk注文用の新しいwebhookを作成します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "为 NivaDesk 订单创建新的 webhook。", "العربية (Arabic)": "أنشئ webhook جديداً لطلبات NivaDesk.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "NivaDesk orders के लिए नया webhook बनाएं."],
    "Set it active": ["Türkçe": "Aktif yapın", "English": "Set it active", "Deutsch": "Aktiv setzen", "Français": "L’activer", "Italiano": "Impostalo attivo", "Español (Spanish)": "Activarlo", "Português": "Ativar", "Русский (Russian)": "Сделайте активным", "日本語 (Japanese)": "有効に設定", "中文 (Chinese)": "设为启用", "العربية (Arabic)": "اجعله نشطاً", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इसे सक्रिय करें"],
    "Set Status to Active and Topic to Order created.": ["Türkçe": "Status alanını Active, Topic alanını Order created yapın.", "English": "Set Status to Active and Topic to Order created.", "Deutsch": "Setzen Sie Status auf Active und Topic auf Order created.", "Français": "Réglez Status sur Active et Topic sur Order created.", "Italiano": "Imposta Status su Active e Topic su Order created.", "Español (Spanish)": "Pon Status en Active y Topic en Order created.", "Português": "Defina Status como Active e Topic como Order created.", "Русский (Russian)": "Установите Status: Active и Topic: Order created.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "StatusをActive、TopicをOrder createdに設定します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "将 Status 设为 Active，Topic 设为 Order created。", "العربية (Arabic)": "اجعل Status على Active و Topic على Order created.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Status को Active और Topic को Order created करें."],
    "Paste the Delivery URL": ["Türkçe": "Delivery URL’yi yapıştırın", "English": "Paste the Delivery URL", "Deutsch": "Delivery URL einfügen", "Français": "Coller la Delivery URL", "Italiano": "Incolla la Delivery URL", "Español (Spanish)": "Pegar la Delivery URL", "Português": "Colar a Delivery URL", "Русский (Russian)": "Вставьте Delivery URL", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Delivery URLを貼り付け", "中文 (Chinese)": "粘贴 Delivery URL", "العربية (Arabic)": "الصق Delivery URL", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Delivery URL पेस्ट करें"],
    "Paste the copied Delivery URL, save the webhook, then place a test order.": ["Türkçe": "Kopyaladığınız Delivery URL’yi yapıştırın, webhook’u kaydedin, sonra bir test siparişi oluşturun.", "English": "Paste the copied Delivery URL, save the webhook, then place a test order.", "Deutsch": "Fügen Sie die kopierte Delivery URL ein, speichern Sie den Webhook und erstellen Sie dann eine Testbestellung.", "Français": "Collez la Delivery URL copiée, enregistrez le webhook, puis passez une commande test.", "Italiano": "Incolla la Delivery URL copiata, salva il webhook, poi crea un ordine di prova.", "Español (Spanish)": "Pega la Delivery URL copiada, guarda el webhook y luego crea un pedido de prueba.", "Português": "Cole a Delivery URL copiada, guarde o webhook e depois faça uma encomenda de teste.", "Русский (Russian)": "Вставьте скопированный Delivery URL, сохраните webhook, затем сделайте тестовый заказ.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "コピーしたDelivery URLを貼り付け、webhookを保存してからテスト注文を作成します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "粘贴复制的 Delivery URL，保存 webhook，然后创建一个测试订单。", "العربية (Arabic)": "الصق Delivery URL المنسوخ، احفظ webhook، ثم أنشئ طلباً تجريبياً.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कॉपी किया हुआ Delivery URL पेस्ट करें, webhook सेव करें, फिर एक टेस्ट ऑर्डर करें."],
    "What happens when it is active": ["Türkçe": "Aktif olunca ne olur", "English": "What happens when it is active", "Deutsch": "Was passiert, wenn es aktiv ist", "Français": "Ce qui se passe une fois actif", "Italiano": "Cosa succede quando è attivo", "Español (Spanish)": "Qué ocurre cuando está activo", "Português": "O que acontece quando fica ativo", "Русский (Russian)": "Что происходит после активации", "日本語 (Japanese)": "有効になるとどうなるか", "中文 (Chinese)": "启用后会发生什么", "العربية (Arabic)": "ماذا يحدث عند التفعيل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सक्रिय होने पर क्या होगा"],
    "New website orders are added to Orders automatically. They also appear in Schedule and are saved under this Company ID.": ["Türkçe": "Yeni web sitesi siparişleri otomatik olarak Orders içine eklenir. Schedule içinde de görünür ve bu Company ID altında kaydedilir.", "English": "New website orders are added to Orders automatically. They also appear in Schedule and are saved under this Company ID.", "Deutsch": "Neue Website-Bestellungen werden automatisch zu Orders hinzugefügt. Sie erscheinen auch im Schedule und werden unter dieser Company ID gespeichert.", "Français": "Les nouvelles commandes du site sont ajoutées automatiquement à Orders. Elles apparaissent aussi dans Schedule et sont enregistrées sous ce Company ID.", "Italiano": "I nuovi ordini del sito vengono aggiunti automaticamente a Orders. Appaiono anche in Schedule e vengono salvati sotto questo Company ID.", "Español (Spanish)": "Los nuevos pedidos web se añaden automáticamente a Orders. También aparecen en Schedule y se guardan bajo este Company ID.", "Português": "As novas encomendas do site são adicionadas automaticamente a Orders. Também aparecem em Schedule e são guardadas neste Company ID.", "Русский (Russian)": "Новые заказы сайта автоматически добавляются в Orders. Они также появляются в Schedule и сохраняются под этим Company ID.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "新しいサイト注文は自動的にOrdersへ追加されます。Scheduleにも表示され、このCompany IDの下に保存されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "新的网站订单会自动添加到 Orders。它们也会显示在 Schedule 中，并保存在此 Company ID 下。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تُضاف طلبات الموقع الجديدة تلقائياً إلى Orders. وتظهر أيضاً في Schedule ويتم حفظها تحت معرّف الشركة هذا.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "नए वेबसाइट ऑर्डर अपने आप Orders में जुड़ेंगे। वे Schedule में भी दिखेंगे और इसी Company ID के तहत सेव होंगे."],
    "Live website orders and webhook setup.": ["Türkçe": "Canlı web sitesi siparişleri ve webhook kurulumu.", "English": "Live website orders and webhook setup.", "Deutsch": "Live-Webshop-Bestellungen und Webhook-Einrichtung.", "Français": "Commandes du site en direct et configuration du webhook.", "Italiano": "Ordini live del sito e configurazione webhook.", "Español (Spanish)": "Pedidos en vivo del sitio y configuración del webhook.", "Português": "Pedidos ao vivo do site e configuração do webhook.", "Русский (Russian)": "Заказы сайта в реальном времени и настройка webhook.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "サイト注文のライブ連携とWebhook設定。", "中文 (Chinese)": "网站实时订单和 webhook 设置。", "العربية (Arabic)": "طلبات الموقع المباشرة وإعداد webhook.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "लाइव वेबसाइट ऑर्डर और webhook सेटअप."],
    "This section explains the live website order connection. It does not change your WooCommerce settings inside the app.": ["Türkçe": "Bu bölüm canlı web sitesi sipariş bağlantısını açıklar. Uygulama içinden WooCommerce ayarlarınızı değiştirmez.", "English": "This section explains the live website order connection. It does not change your WooCommerce settings inside the app.", "Deutsch": "Dieser Bereich erklärt die Live-Bestellverbindung. Er ändert keine WooCommerce-Einstellungen in der App.", "Français": "Cette section explique la connexion des commandes en direct. Elle ne modifie pas vos réglages WooCommerce dans l’app.", "Italiano": "Questa sezione spiega la connessione ordini live. Non modifica le impostazioni WooCommerce nell’app.", "Español (Spanish)": "Esta sección explica la conexión de pedidos en vivo. No cambia los ajustes de WooCommerce dentro de la app.", "Português": "Esta seção explica a ligação de pedidos ao vivo. Não altera as definições do WooCommerce na app.", "Русский (Russian)": "Этот раздел объясняет подключение заказов сайта. Он не меняет настройки WooCommerce в приложении.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このセクションはサイト注文のライブ接続を説明します。アプリ内でWooCommerce設定は変更しません。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此部分说明网站订单实时连接，不会在应用内更改 WooCommerce 设置。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يوضح هذا القسم اتصال طلبات الموقع المباشر. ولا يغيّر إعدادات WooCommerce داخل التطبيق.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह सेक्शन लाइव वेबसाइट ऑर्डर कनेक्शन समझाता है। यह ऐप के अंदर WooCommerce सेटिंग्स नहीं बदलता."],
    "When a customer completes an order on your website, WooCommerce sends the order data to NivaDesk. NivaDesk saves it into the correct company workspace and the app shows it automatically.": ["Türkçe": "Bir müşteri web sitenizde siparişi tamamladığında WooCommerce sipariş verisini NivaDesk’a gönderir. NivaDesk bunu doğru şirket workspace’ine kaydeder ve uygulama otomatik gösterir.", "English": "When a customer completes an order on your website, WooCommerce sends the order data to NivaDesk. NivaDesk saves it into the correct company workspace and the app shows it automatically.", "Deutsch": "Wenn ein Kunde im Webshop bestellt, sendet WooCommerce die Bestelldaten an NivaDesk. NivaDesk speichert sie im richtigen Unternehmens-Workspace und zeigt sie automatisch an.", "Français": "Quand un client termine une commande sur votre site, WooCommerce envoie les données à NivaDesk. NivaDesk les enregistre dans le bon espace société et l’app les affiche automatiquement.", "Italiano": "Quando un cliente completa un ordine sul sito, WooCommerce invia i dati a NivaDesk. NivaDesk li salva nello spazio aziendale corretto e l’app li mostra automaticamente.", "Español (Spanish)": "Cuando un cliente completa un pedido en tu web, WooCommerce envía los datos a NivaDesk. NivaDesk los guarda en el espacio de empresa correcto y la app los muestra automáticamente.", "Português": "Quando um cliente conclui um pedido no site, o WooCommerce envia os dados ao NivaDesk. O NivaDesk guarda no workspace correto e a app mostra automaticamente.", "Русский (Russian)": "Когда клиент завершает заказ на сайте, WooCommerce отправляет данные в NivaDesk. NivaDesk сохраняет их в нужном рабочем пространстве компании, и приложение показывает заказ автоматически.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "お客様がサイトで注文を完了すると、WooCommerceが注文データをNivaDeskへ送ります。NivaDeskは正しい会社ワークスペースに保存し、アプリに自動表示します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "客户在网站完成订单后，WooCommerce 会把订单数据发送到 NivaDesk。NivaDesk 会保存到正确的公司工作区，应用会自动显示。", "العربية (Arabic)": "عند إكمال العميل طلباً على موقعك، يرسل WooCommerce بيانات الطلب إلى NivaDesk. يحفظها NivaDesk في مساحة الشركة الصحيحة وتظهر تلقائياً في التطبيق.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "जब ग्राहक वेबसाइट पर ऑर्डर पूरा करता है, WooCommerce ऑर्डर डेटा NivaDesk को भेजता है। NivaDesk इसे सही कंपनी workspace में सेव करता है और ऐप इसे अपने आप दिखाता है."],
    "WooCommerce sends the new order": ["Türkçe": "WooCommerce yeni siparişi gönderir", "English": "WooCommerce sends the new order", "Deutsch": "WooCommerce sendet die neue Bestellung", "Français": "WooCommerce envoie la nouvelle commande", "Italiano": "WooCommerce invia il nuovo ordine", "Español (Spanish)": "WooCommerce envía el nuevo pedido", "Português": "WooCommerce envia o novo pedido", "Русский (Russian)": "WooCommerce отправляет новый заказ", "日本語 (Japanese)": "WooCommerceが新規注文を送信", "中文 (Chinese)": "WooCommerce 发送新订单", "العربية (Arabic)": "يرسل WooCommerce الطلب الجديد", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "WooCommerce नया ऑर्डर भेजता है"],
    "Your website webhook sends customer, product and payment details when an order is created or completed.": ["Türkçe": "Web sitenizdeki webhook, sipariş oluşturulduğunda veya tamamlandığında müşteri, ürün ve ödeme bilgilerini gönderir.", "English": "Your website webhook sends customer, product and payment details when an order is created or completed.", "Deutsch": "Der Website-Webhook sendet Kunden-, Produkt- und Zahlungsdaten, wenn eine Bestellung erstellt oder abgeschlossen wird.", "Français": "Le webhook du site envoie les détails client, produit et paiement quand une commande est créée ou terminée.", "Italiano": "Il webhook del sito invia dati cliente, prodotto e pagamento quando un ordine viene creato o completato.", "Español (Spanish)": "El webhook del sitio envía datos de cliente, producto y pago cuando se crea o completa un pedido.", "Português": "O webhook do site envia dados de cliente, produto e pagamento quando um pedido é criado ou concluído.", "Русский (Russian)": "Webhook сайта отправляет данные клиента, товара и оплаты при создании или завершении заказа.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "サイトのWebhookは注文作成または完了時に顧客、商品、支払い情報を送信します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "网站 webhook 会在订单创建或完成时发送客户、产品和付款信息。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يرسل webhook في الموقع تفاصيل العميل والمنتج والدفع عند إنشاء الطلب أو اكتماله.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "वेबसाइट webhook ऑर्डर बनने या पूरा होने पर ग्राहक, उत्पाद और भुगतान विवरण भेजता है."],
    "Cloud Function converts the data": ["Türkçe": "Cloud Function veriyi dönüştürür", "English": "Cloud Function converts the data", "Deutsch": "Cloud Function wandelt die Daten um", "Français": "Cloud Function convertit les données", "Italiano": "Cloud Function converte i dati", "Español (Spanish)": "Cloud Function convierte los datos", "Português": "Cloud Function converte os dados", "Русский (Russian)": "Cloud Function преобразует данные", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Cloud Functionがデータを変換", "中文 (Chinese)": "Cloud Function 转换数据", "العربية (Arabic)": "تحوّل Cloud Function البيانات", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Cloud Function डेटा बदलता है"],
    "The Firebase function receives the WooCommerce payload and converts it into the NivaDesk order format.": ["Türkçe": "Firebase fonksiyonu WooCommerce verisini alır ve NivaDesk sipariş formatına çevirir.", "English": "The Firebase function receives the WooCommerce payload and converts it into the NivaDesk order format.", "Deutsch": "Die Firebase-Funktion empfängt die WooCommerce-Daten und wandelt sie ins NivaDesk-Bestellformat um.", "Français": "La fonction Firebase reçoit les données WooCommerce et les convertit au format de commande NivaDesk.", "Italiano": "La funzione Firebase riceve il payload WooCommerce e lo converte nel formato ordine NivaDesk.", "Español (Spanish)": "La función Firebase recibe el payload de WooCommerce y lo convierte al formato de pedido NivaDesk.", "Português": "A função Firebase recebe o payload do WooCommerce e converte para o formato de pedido NivaDesk.", "Русский (Russian)": "Функция Firebase получает payload WooCommerce и преобразует его в формат заказа NivaDesk.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Firebase関数がWooCommerceのデータを受け取り、NivaDeskの注文形式へ変換します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "Firebase 函数接收 WooCommerce 数据并转换为 NivaDesk 订单格式。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تستقبل دالة Firebase بيانات WooCommerce وتحولها إلى تنسيق طلب NivaDesk.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Firebase function WooCommerce payload लेकर उसे NivaDesk ऑर्डर फ़ॉर्मेट में बदलता है."],
    "Firestore saves it securely": ["Türkçe": "Firestore güvenli şekilde kaydeder", "English": "Firestore saves it securely", "Deutsch": "Firestore speichert sie sicher", "Français": "Firestore l’enregistre en sécurité", "Italiano": "Firestore lo salva in sicurezza", "Español (Spanish)": "Firestore lo guarda de forma segura", "Português": "Firestore guarda com segurança", "Русский (Russian)": "Firestore безопасно сохраняет", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Firestoreが安全に保存", "中文 (Chinese)": "Firestore 安全保存", "العربية (Arabic)": "يحفظه Firestore بأمان", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Firestore इसे सुरक्षित सेव करता है"],
    "The order is saved with your companyId, so it appears only inside the correct workspace.": ["Türkçe": "Sipariş companyId ile kaydedilir, bu yüzden sadece doğru workspace içinde görünür.", "English": "The order is saved with your companyId, so it appears only inside the correct workspace.", "Deutsch": "Die Bestellung wird mit Ihrer companyId gespeichert und erscheint nur im richtigen Workspace.", "Français": "La commande est enregistrée avec votre companyId et apparaît seulement dans le bon espace.", "Italiano": "L’ordine viene salvato con il tuo companyId e appare solo nello spazio corretto.", "Español (Spanish)": "El pedido se guarda con tu companyId y aparece solo en el espacio correcto.", "Português": "O pedido é guardado com o seu companyId e aparece apenas no workspace correto.", "Русский (Russian)": "Заказ сохраняется с вашим companyId и появляется только в нужном workspace.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "注文はcompanyId付きで保存され、正しいワークスペースにのみ表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "订单会带 companyId 保存，因此只显示在正确的工作区中。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يُحفظ الطلب مع companyId الخاص بك، لذلك يظهر فقط داخل مساحة العمل الصحيحة.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऑर्डर आपके companyId के साथ सेव होता है, इसलिए यह केवल सही workspace में दिखता है."],
    "The app updates live": ["Türkçe": "Uygulama canlı güncellenir", "English": "The app updates live", "Deutsch": "Die App aktualisiert live", "Français": "L’app se met à jour en direct", "Italiano": "L’app si aggiorna in tempo reale", "Español (Spanish)": "La app se actualiza en vivo", "Português": "A app atualiza em tempo real", "Русский (Russian)": "Приложение обновляется в реальном времени", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アプリがリアルタイム更新", "中文 (Chinese)": "应用实时更新", "العربية (Arabic)": "يتحدث التطبيق مباشرة", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऐप लाइव अपडेट होता है"],
    "The app listens to Firebase in real time, so the new website order appears without refreshing.": ["Türkçe": "Uygulama Firebase’i anlık dinler; yeni web sitesi siparişi yenileme yapmadan görünür.", "English": "The app listens to Firebase in real time, so the new website order appears without refreshing.", "Deutsch": "Die App hört Firebase in Echtzeit ab, daher erscheint die neue Website-Bestellung ohne Aktualisieren.", "Français": "L’app écoute Firebase en temps réel, donc la nouvelle commande apparaît sans actualisation.", "Italiano": "L’app ascolta Firebase in tempo reale, quindi il nuovo ordine appare senza aggiornare.", "Español (Spanish)": "La app escucha Firebase en tiempo real, así el nuevo pedido aparece sin refrescar.", "Português": "A app escuta o Firebase em tempo real, então o novo pedido aparece sem atualizar.", "Русский (Russian)": "Приложение слушает Firebase в реальном времени, поэтому новый заказ появляется без обновления.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アプリはFirebaseをリアルタイムで監視するため、新しいサイト注文が更新なしで表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "应用实时监听 Firebase，新网站订单无需刷新即可出现。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يستمع التطبيق إلى Firebase مباشرة، لذلك يظهر طلب الموقع الجديد دون تحديث.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऐप Firebase को रियल टाइम में सुनता है, इसलिए नया वेबसाइट ऑर्डर बिना refresh के दिखता है."],
    "Webhook Setup": ["Türkçe": "Webhook Kurulumu", "English": "Webhook Setup", "Deutsch": "Webhook-Einrichtung", "Français": "Configuration du webhook", "Italiano": "Configurazione webhook", "Español (Spanish)": "Configuración del webhook", "Português": "Configuração do webhook", "Русский (Russian)": "Настройка webhook", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Webhook設定", "中文 (Chinese)": "Webhook 设置", "العربية (Arabic)": "إعداد webhook", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Webhook सेटअप"],
    "Use this endpoint as the WooCommerce webhook Delivery URL:": ["Türkçe": "Bu adresi WooCommerce webhook Delivery URL olarak kullanın:", "English": "Use this endpoint as the WooCommerce webhook Delivery URL:", "Deutsch": "Verwenden Sie diesen Endpunkt als WooCommerce Webhook Delivery URL:", "Français": "Utilisez ce point d’accès comme Delivery URL du webhook WooCommerce :", "Italiano": "Usa questo endpoint come Delivery URL del webhook WooCommerce:", "Español (Spanish)": "Usa este endpoint como Delivery URL del webhook de WooCommerce:", "Português": "Use este endpoint como Delivery URL do webhook WooCommerce:", "Русский (Russian)": "Используйте этот endpoint как Delivery URL webhook WooCommerce:", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このエンドポイントをWooCommerce webhookのDelivery URLとして使用してください：", "中文 (Chinese)": "将此端点用作 WooCommerce webhook 的 Delivery URL：", "العربية (Arabic)": "استخدم هذا العنوان كـ Delivery URL لـ webhook في WooCommerce:", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस endpoint को WooCommerce webhook Delivery URL के रूप में इस्तेमाल करें:"],
    "Replace YOUR_COMPANY_ID with the Company ID shown in Settings > Account > Team Access.": ["Türkçe": "YOUR_COMPANY_ID kısmını Settings > Account > Team Access içinde görünen Company ID ile değiştirin.", "English": "Replace YOUR_COMPANY_ID with the Company ID shown in Settings > Account > Team Access.", "Deutsch": "Ersetzen Sie YOUR_COMPANY_ID durch die Company ID unter Settings > Account > Team Access.", "Français": "Remplacez YOUR_COMPANY_ID par le Company ID affiché dans Settings > Account > Team Access.", "Italiano": "Sostituisci YOUR_COMPANY_ID con il Company ID mostrato in Settings > Account > Team Access.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sustituye YOUR_COMPANY_ID por el Company ID mostrado en Settings > Account > Team Access.", "Português": "Substitua YOUR_COMPANY_ID pelo Company ID em Settings > Account > Team Access.", "Русский (Russian)": "Замените YOUR_COMPANY_ID на Company ID из Settings > Account > Team Access.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "YOUR_COMPANY_IDを Settings > Account > Team Access に表示されるCompany IDに置き換えてください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "将 YOUR_COMPANY_ID 替换为 Settings > Account > Team Access 中显示的 Company ID。", "العربية (Arabic)": "استبدل YOUR_COMPANY_ID بمعرّف Company ID الموجود في Settings > Account > Team Access.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "YOUR_COMPANY_ID को Settings > Account > Team Access में दिख रहे Company ID से बदलें."],
    "Recommended WooCommerce webhook settings": ["Türkçe": "Önerilen WooCommerce webhook ayarları", "English": "Recommended WooCommerce webhook settings", "Deutsch": "Empfohlene WooCommerce-Webhook-Einstellungen", "Français": "Réglages webhook WooCommerce recommandés", "Italiano": "Impostazioni webhook WooCommerce consigliate", "Español (Spanish)": "Ajustes recomendados del webhook WooCommerce", "Português": "Definições recomendadas do webhook WooCommerce", "Русский (Russian)": "Рекомендуемые настройки webhook WooCommerce", "日本語 (Japanese)": "推奨WooCommerce webhook設定", "中文 (Chinese)": "推荐的 WooCommerce webhook 设置", "العربية (Arabic)": "إعدادات webhook WooCommerce الموصى بها", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "अनुशंसित WooCommerce webhook सेटिंग्स"],
    "Topic: Order created or Order updated": ["Türkçe": "Konu: Order created veya Order updated", "English": "Topic: Order created or Order updated", "Deutsch": "Thema: Order created oder Order updated", "Français": "Sujet : Order created ou Order updated", "Italiano": "Topic: Order created o Order updated", "Español (Spanish)": "Tema: Order created u Order updated", "Português": "Tópico: Order created ou Order updated", "Русский (Russian)": "Тема: Order created или Order updated", "日本語 (Japanese)": "トピック：Order created または Order updated", "中文 (Chinese)": "主题：Order created 或 Order updated", "العربية (Arabic)": "الموضوع: Order created أو Order updated", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Topic: Order created या Order updated"],
    "Delivery URL: the endpoint above": ["Türkçe": "Delivery URL: yukarıdaki endpoint", "English": "Delivery URL: the endpoint above", "Deutsch": "Delivery URL: der Endpunkt oben", "Français": "Delivery URL : le point d’accès ci-dessus", "Italiano": "Delivery URL: l’endpoint sopra", "Español (Spanish)": "Delivery URL: el endpoint anterior", "Português": "Delivery URL: o endpoint acima", "Русский (Russian)": "Delivery URL: endpoint выше", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Delivery URL：上記のエンドポイント", "中文 (Chinese)": "Delivery URL：上方端点", "العربية (Arabic)": "Delivery URL: العنوان أعلاه", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Delivery URL: ऊपर वाला endpoint"],
    "Connection Check": ["Türkçe": "Bağlantı Kontrolü", "English": "Connection Check", "Deutsch": "Verbindungsprüfung", "Français": "Vérification de connexion", "Italiano": "Controllo connessione", "Español (Spanish)": "Comprobación de conexión", "Português": "Verificação da ligação", "Русский (Russian)": "Проверка подключения", "日本語 (Japanese)": "接続チェック", "中文 (Chinese)": "连接检查", "العربية (Arabic)": "فحص الاتصال", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "कनेक्शन जाँच"],
    "App real-time listener": ["Türkçe": "Uygulama anlık dinleyici", "English": "App real-time listener", "Deutsch": "App-Echtzeit-Listener", "Français": "Écoute en temps réel de l’app", "Italiano": "Listener live dell’app", "Español (Spanish)": "Listener en tiempo real de la app", "Português": "Listener em tempo real da app", "Русский (Russian)": "Realtime listener приложения", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アプリのリアルタイムリスナー", "中文 (Chinese)": "应用实时监听器", "العربية (Arabic)": "مستمع التطبيق المباشر", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऐप real-time listener"],
    "Active. NivaDesk listens to Firestore orders for the current companyId.": ["Türkçe": "Aktif. NivaDesk mevcut companyId için Firestore siparişlerini dinliyor.", "English": "Active. NivaDesk listens to Firestore orders for the current companyId.", "Deutsch": "Aktiv. NivaDesk hört Firestore-Bestellungen für die aktuelle companyId ab.", "Français": "Actif. NivaDesk écoute les commandes Firestore du companyId actuel.", "Italiano": "Attivo. NivaDesk ascolta gli ordini Firestore per il companyId corrente.", "Español (Spanish)": "Activo. NivaDesk escucha pedidos de Firestore para el companyId actual.", "Português": "Ativo. NivaDesk escuta pedidos Firestore para o companyId atual.", "Русский (Russian)": "Активно. NivaDesk слушает заказы Firestore для текущего companyId.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "有効。NivaDeskは現在のcompanyIdのFirestore注文を監視しています。", "中文 (Chinese)": "已启用。NivaDesk 正在监听当前 companyId 的 Firestore 订单。", "العربية (Arabic)": "نشط. يستمع NivaDesk إلى طلبات Firestore للـ companyId الحالي.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "सक्रिय। NivaDesk वर्तमान companyId के Firestore orders को सुनता है."],
    "Cloud webhook function": ["Türkçe": "Cloud webhook fonksiyonu", "English": "Cloud webhook function", "Deutsch": "Cloud-Webhook-Funktion", "Français": "Fonction cloud webhook", "Italiano": "Funzione cloud webhook", "Español (Spanish)": "Función cloud webhook", "Português": "Função cloud webhook", "Русский (Russian)": "Cloud webhook функция", "日本語 (Japanese)": "Cloud webhook関数", "中文 (Chinese)": "Cloud webhook 函数", "العربية (Arabic)": "دالة cloud webhook", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "Cloud webhook function"],
    "Included in this build. Deploy Firebase Functions after replacing index.js.": ["Türkçe": "Bu build’e eklendi. index.js değiştirildikten sonra Firebase Functions deploy edin.", "English": "Included in this build. Deploy Firebase Functions after replacing index.js.", "Deutsch": "In diesem Build enthalten. Nach dem Ersetzen von index.js Firebase Functions deployen.", "Français": "Inclus dans ce build. Déployez Firebase Functions après avoir remplacé index.js.", "Italiano": "Incluso in questa build. Distribuisci Firebase Functions dopo aver sostituito index.js.", "Español (Spanish)": "Incluido en esta build. Despliega Firebase Functions después de reemplazar index.js.", "Português": "Incluído nesta build. Faça deploy do Firebase Functions após substituir index.js.", "Русский (Russian)": "Включено в этот build. Разверните Firebase Functions после замены index.js.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このビルドに含まれています。index.jsを置き換えた後、Firebase Functionsをデプロイしてください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "已包含在此版本中。替换 index.js 后请部署 Firebase Functions。", "العربية (Arabic)": "موجود في هذا الإصدار. انشر Firebase Functions بعد استبدال index.js.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस build में शामिल है। index.js बदलने के बाद Firebase Functions deploy करें."],
