    "Workspace Logo": ["Türkçe": "Workspace Logosu", "English": "Workspace Logo", "Deutsch": "Workspace-Logo", "Français": "Logo de l’espace de travail", "Italiano": "Logo workspace", "Español (Spanish)": "Logo del espacio de trabajo", "Português": "Logótipo do workspace", "Русский (Russian)": "Логотип рабочей области", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ワークスペースロゴ", "中文 (Chinese)": "工作区标志", "العربية (Arabic)": "شعار مساحة العمل", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "वर्कस्पेस लोगो"],
    "App Logo URL": ["Türkçe": "Uygulama Logo URL", "English": "App Logo URL", "Deutsch": "App-Logo-URL", "Français": "URL du logo de l’app", "Italiano": "URL logo app", "Español (Spanish)": "URL del logo de la app", "Português": "URL do logótipo da app", "Русский (Russian)": "URL логотипа приложения", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アプリロゴURL", "中文 (Chinese)": "应用标志 URL", "العربية (Arabic)": "رابط شعار التطبيق", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऐप लोगो URL"],
    "Upload Logo": ["Türkçe": "Logo Yükle", "English": "Upload Logo", "Deutsch": "Logo hochladen", "Français": "Téléverser le logo", "Italiano": "Carica logo", "Español (Spanish)": "Subir logo", "Português": "Carregar logótipo", "Русский (Russian)": "Загрузить логотип", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ロゴをアップロード", "中文 (Chinese)": "上传标志", "العربية (Arabic)": "رفع الشعار", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "लोगो अपलोड करें"],
    "Logo could not be loaded": ["Türkçe": "Logo yüklenemedi", "English": "Logo could not be loaded", "Deutsch": "Logo konnte nicht geladen werden", "Français": "Le logo n’a pas pu être chargé", "Italiano": "Impossibile caricare il logo", "Español (Spanish)": "No se pudo cargar el logo", "Português": "Não foi possível carregar o logótipo", "Русский (Russian)": "Не удалось загрузить логотип", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ロゴを読み込めませんでした", "中文 (Chinese)": "无法加载标志", "العربية (Arabic)": "تعذر تحميل الشعار", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "लोगो लोड नहीं हो सका"],
    "Workspace logo is managed from Account > Workspace Logo.": ["Türkçe": "Workspace logosu Account > Workspace Logo içinden yönetilir.", "English": "Workspace logo is managed from Account > Workspace Logo.", "Deutsch": "Das Workspace-Logo wird unter Account > Workspace Logo verwaltet.", "Français": "Le logo de l’espace de travail se gère dans Account > Workspace Logo.", "Italiano": "Il logo workspace si gestisce da Account > Workspace Logo.", "Español (Spanish)": "El logo del espacio de trabajo se gestiona desde Account > Workspace Logo.", "Português": "O logótipo do workspace é gerido em Account > Workspace Logo.", "Русский (Russian)": "Логотип рабочей области настраивается в Account > Workspace Logo.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ワークスペースロゴは Account > Workspace Logo で管理します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "工作区标志在 Account > Workspace Logo 中管理。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تتم إدارة شعار مساحة العمل من Account > Workspace Logo.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "वर्कस्पेस लोगो Account > Workspace Logo से प्रबंधित होता है."],
    "Upload or paste the logo used in the app header for this workspace. Logo uploads follow the same upload safety policy and audit log as order images.": ["Türkçe": "Bu workspace için uygulama başlığında kullanılacak logoyu yükleyin veya logo URL’si yapıştırın. Logo yüklemeleri, sipariş görselleriyle aynı güvenlik politikası ve audit log sistemini kullanır.", "English": "Upload or paste the logo used in the app header for this workspace. Logo uploads follow the same upload safety policy and audit log as order images.", "Deutsch": "Laden Sie das Logo für diesen Workspace hoch oder fügen Sie eine Logo-URL ein. Logo-Uploads nutzen dieselbe Upload-Sicherheitsrichtlinie und Audit-Log wie Bestellbilder.", "Français": "Téléversez ou collez le logo utilisé dans l’en-tête de l’app pour cet espace de travail. Les logos suivent la même politique de sécurité et le même journal d’audit que les images de commande.", "Italiano": "Carica o incolla il logo usato nell’intestazione dell’app per questo workspace. I caricamenti del logo seguono la stessa policy di sicurezza e audit log delle immagini ordine.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sube o pega el logo usado en el encabezado de la app para este espacio de trabajo. Los logos usan la misma política de seguridad y registro de auditoría que las imágenes de pedidos.", "Português": "Carregue ou cole o logótipo usado no cabeçalho da app para este workspace. Os logótipos usam a mesma política de segurança e registo de auditoria das imagens de encomendas.", "Русский (Russian)": "Загрузите или вставьте URL логотипа для шапки приложения в этой рабочей области. Логотипы используют ту же политику безопасности и журнал аудита, что и изображения заказов.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このワークスペースのアプリヘッダーで使うロゴをアップロードするかURLを貼り付けます。ロゴも注文画像と同じアップロード安全ポリシーと監査ログを使用します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "上传或粘贴此工作区应用标题中使用的标志。标志上传使用与订单图片相同的上传安全策略和审计日志。", "العربية (Arabic)": "ارفع أو الصق الشعار المستخدم في رأس التطبيق لهذه المساحة. تستخدم شعارات العمل نفس سياسة أمان الرفع وسجل التدقيق مثل صور الطلبات.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "इस workspace के ऐप हेडर के लिए लोगो अपलोड करें या URL चिपकाएँ। लोगो अपलोड order images जैसी upload safety policy और audit log का उपयोग करते हैं."],
    "This logo is used in the app header on Mac, iPad and iPhone.": ["Türkçe": "Bu logo Mac, iPad ve iPhone’da uygulama başlığında kullanılır.", "English": "This logo is used in the app header on Mac, iPad and iPhone.", "Deutsch": "Dieses Logo wird in der App-Kopfzeile auf Mac, iPad und iPhone verwendet.", "Français": "Ce logo est utilisé dans l’en-tête de l’app sur Mac, iPad et iPhone.", "Italiano": "Questo logo viene usato nell’intestazione dell’app su Mac, iPad e iPhone.", "Español (Spanish)": "Este logo se usa en el encabezado de la app en Mac, iPad y iPhone.", "Português": "Este logótipo é usado no cabeçalho da app em Mac, iPad e iPhone.", "Русский (Russian)": "Этот логотип используется в шапке приложения на Mac, iPad и iPhone.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "このロゴはMac、iPad、iPhoneのアプリヘッダーで使用されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "此标志用于 Mac、iPad 和 iPhone 上的应用标题。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يُستخدم هذا الشعار في رأس التطبيق على Mac وiPad وiPhone.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "यह लोगो Mac, iPad और iPhone पर ऐप हेडर में उपयोग होता है."],
    "Logo uploads use the same upload safety rules and audit log.": ["Türkçe": "Logo yüklemeleri aynı upload safety kuralları ve audit log sistemini kullanır.", "English": "Logo uploads use the same upload safety rules and audit log.", "Deutsch": "Logo-Uploads verwenden dieselben Upload-Sicherheitsregeln und Audit-Logs.", "Français": "Les logos utilisent les mêmes règles de sécurité de téléversement et le même journal d’audit.", "Italiano": "I caricamenti del logo usano le stesse regole di sicurezza e audit log.", "Español (Spanish)": "Las subidas de logo usan las mismas reglas de seguridad y registro de auditoría.", "Português": "Os carregamentos de logótipo usam as mesmas regras de segurança e registo de auditoria.", "Русский (Russian)": "Загрузки логотипа используют те же правила безопасности и журнал аудита.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ロゴのアップロードも同じ安全ルールと監査ログを使用します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "标志上传使用相同的上传安全规则和审计日志。", "العربية (Arabic)": "تستخدم عمليات رفع الشعار نفس قواعد أمان الرفع وسجل التدقيق.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "लोगो अपलोड उसी upload safety rules और audit log का उपयोग करते हैं."],
    "Upload a logo or paste a logo URL. Uploaded logos are stored under this workspace and recorded in the upload audit log.": ["Türkçe": "Bir logo yükleyin veya logo URL’si yapıştırın. Yüklenen logolar bu workspace altında saklanır ve upload audit log içine kaydedilir.", "English": "Upload a logo or paste a logo URL. Uploaded logos are stored under this workspace and recorded in the upload audit log.", "Deutsch": "Laden Sie ein Logo hoch oder fügen Sie eine Logo-URL ein. Hochgeladene Logos werden in diesem Workspace gespeichert und im Upload-Audit-Log erfasst.", "Français": "Téléversez un logo ou collez une URL de logo. Les logos sont enregistrés dans cet espace de travail et dans le journal d’audit.", "Italiano": "Carica un logo o incolla un URL logo. I loghi caricati sono salvati in questo workspace e registrati nell’audit log.", "Español (Spanish)": "Sube un logo o pega una URL. Los logos subidos se guardan en este espacio de trabajo y se registran en el audit log.", "Português": "Carregue um logótipo ou cole um URL. Os logótipos carregados são guardados neste workspace e registados no audit log.", "Русский (Russian)": "Загрузите логотип или вставьте URL. Загруженные логотипы хранятся в этой рабочей области и записываются в журнал аудита.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "ロゴをアップロードするかURLを貼り付けます。アップロードしたロゴはこのワークスペースに保存され、監査ログに記録されます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "上传标志或粘贴标志 URL。上传的标志会存储在此工作区并记录到上传审计日志。", "العربية (Arabic)": "ارفع شعارًا أو الصق رابط الشعار. تُخزن الشعارات ضمن مساحة العمل هذه وتُسجل في سجل تدقيق الرفع.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "लोगो अपलोड करें या लोगो URL चिपकाएँ। अपलोड किए गए लोगो इस workspace में स्टोर होते हैं और upload audit log में रिकॉर्ड होते हैं."],
    "The app only accepts common image files such as JPG, PNG, HEIC and WEBP for order previews and workspace logos.": ["Türkçe": "Uygulama, order preview ve workspace logosu için sadece JPG, PNG, HEIC ve WEBP gibi yaygın görsel dosyalarını kabul eder.", "English": "The app only accepts common image files such as JPG, PNG, HEIC and WEBP for order previews and workspace logos.", "Deutsch": "Die App akzeptiert nur gängige Bilddateien wie JPG, PNG, HEIC und WEBP für Bestellvorschauen und Workspace-Logos.", "Français": "L’app accepte uniquement les fichiers image courants comme JPG, PNG, HEIC et WEBP pour les aperçus de commande et les logos d’espace de travail.", "Italiano": "L’app accetta solo immagini comuni come JPG, PNG, HEIC e WEBP per anteprime ordine e loghi workspace.", "Español (Spanish)": "La app solo acepta imágenes comunes como JPG, PNG, HEIC y WEBP para vistas previas de pedidos y logos del espacio de trabajo.", "Português": "A app só aceita imagens comuns como JPG, PNG, HEIC e WEBP para pré-visualizações de encomendas e logótipos do workspace.", "Русский (Russian)": "Приложение принимает только распространенные изображения JPG, PNG, HEIC и WEBP для превью заказов и логотипов рабочей области.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "アプリは注文プレビューとワークスペースロゴにJPG、PNG、HEIC、WEBPなど一般的な画像のみ受け付けます。", "中文 (Chinese)": "应用仅接受 JPG、PNG、HEIC 和 WEBP 等常见图片，用于订单预览和工作区标志。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يقبل التطبيق ملفات الصور الشائعة فقط مثل JPG وPNG وHEIC وWEBP لمعاينات الطلبات وشعارات مساحة العمل.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "ऐप order previews और workspace logos के लिए केवल JPG, PNG, HEIC और WEBP जैसी सामान्य image files स्वीकार करता है."],
    "Each upload records the company, user, file type, file size, upload date, source and related order when available.": ["Türkçe": "Her yükleme; şirket, kullanıcı, dosya türü, dosya boyutu, yükleme tarihi, kaynak ve varsa ilgili sipariş bilgisiyle kaydedilir.", "English": "Each upload records the company, user, file type, file size, upload date, source and related order when available.", "Deutsch": "Jeder Upload speichert Firma, Nutzer, Dateityp, Dateigröße, Upload-Datum, Quelle und, wenn vorhanden, die zugehörige Bestellung.", "Français": "Chaque téléversement enregistre l’entreprise, l’utilisateur, le type et la taille du fichier, la date, la source et la commande liée si disponible.", "Italiano": "Ogni upload registra azienda, utente, tipo file, dimensione, data, sorgente e ordine collegato se disponibile.", "Español (Spanish)": "Cada subida registra la empresa, usuario, tipo y tamaño de archivo, fecha, origen y pedido relacionado si existe.", "Português": "Cada upload regista empresa, utilizador, tipo e tamanho do ficheiro, data, origem e encomenda relacionada quando existir.", "Русский (Russian)": "Каждая загрузка записывает компанию, пользователя, тип файла, размер, дату, источник и связанный заказ, если он есть.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "各アップロードは会社、ユーザー、ファイル種類、サイズ、日時、ソース、関連注文を記録します。", "中文 (Chinese)": "每次上传都会记录公司、用户、文件类型、大小、上传日期、来源以及相关订单。", "العربية (Arabic)": "يسجل كل رفع الشركة والمستخدم ونوع الملف وحجمه وتاريخ الرفع والمصدر والطلب المرتبط إن وجد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "हर upload में company, user, file type, file size, upload date, source और उपलब्ध related order रिकॉर्ड होता है."],
    "Client Files": ["Türkçe": "Müşteri Dosyaları", "English": "Client Files"],
    "PDF and image files for this order.": ["Türkçe": "Bu siparişe ait PDF ve görsel dosyalar.", "English": "PDF and image files for this order."],
    "Visible to workspace members who can open this order.": ["Türkçe": "Bu siparişi açabilen workspace üyeleri tarafından görülebilir.", "English": "Visible to workspace members who can open this order."],
    "Upload File": ["Türkçe": "Dosya Yükle", "English": "Upload File"],
    "Photo Library": ["Türkçe": "Galeriden Seç", "English": "Photo Library"],
    "Camera": ["Türkçe": "Kamera", "English": "Camera"],
    "Files": ["Türkçe": "Dosyalardan Seç", "English": "Files"],
    "Choose where to add the client file from.": ["Türkçe": "Müşteri dosyasını nereden eklemek istediğinizi seçin.", "English": "Choose where to add the client file from."],
    "Preparing photo...": ["Türkçe": "Fotoğraf hazırlanıyor...", "English": "Preparing photo..."],
    "Could not read selected photo.": ["Türkçe": "Seçilen fotoğraf okunamadı.", "English": "Could not read selected photo."],
    "Could not read camera photo.": ["Türkçe": "Kamera fotoğrafı okunamadı.", "English": "Could not read camera photo."],
    "No client files yet.": ["Türkçe": "Henüz müşteri dosyası yok.", "English": "No client files yet."],
    "Upload PDFs or images that belong to this client order.": ["Türkçe": "Bu müşteri siparişine ait PDF veya görselleri yükleyin.", "English": "Upload PDFs or images that belong to this client order."],
    "Allowed: PDF, JPG, PNG, HEIC, HEIF and WEBP. The size limit follows Settings > Safety & Uploads.": ["Türkçe": "İzin verilenler: PDF, JPG, PNG, HEIC, HEIF ve WEBP. Boyut limiti Settings > Safety & Uploads ayarını takip eder.", "English": "Allowed: PDF, JPG, PNG, HEIC, HEIF and WEBP. The size limit follows Settings > Safety & Uploads."],
    "Choose a PDF or image file for this order.": ["Türkçe": "Bu sipariş için PDF veya görsel dosya seçin.", "English": "Choose a PDF or image file for this order."],
    "File uploaded": ["Türkçe": "Dosya yüklendi", "English": "File uploaded"],
    "Waiting to upload": ["Türkçe": "Yükleme bekliyor", "English": "Waiting to upload"],
    "Offline. File saved locally and will upload when online.": ["Türkçe": "Offline. Dosya bu cihaza kaydedildi ve bağlantı gelince otomatik yüklenecek.", "English": "Offline. File saved locally and will upload when online."],
    "This file is saved on this device and will upload automatically when online.": ["Türkçe": "Bu dosya bu cihazda saklanıyor ve online olunca otomatik yüklenecek.", "English": "This file is saved on this device and will upload automatically when online."],
    "Pending upload removed": ["Türkçe": "Bekleyen yükleme kaldırıldı", "English": "Pending upload removed"],
    "Pending client file removed": ["Türkçe": "Bekleyen müşteri dosyası kaldırıldı", "English": "Pending client file removed"],
    "Open local file": ["Türkçe": "Yerel dosyayı aç", "English": "Open local file"],
    "File deleted": ["Türkçe": "Dosya silindi", "English": "File deleted"],
    "Client file uploaded": ["Türkçe": "Müşteri dosyası yüklendi", "English": "Client file uploaded"],
    "Client file deleted": ["Türkçe": "Müşteri dosyası silindi", "English": "Client file deleted"],
    "Order previews, logos and avatars accept image files. Client Files accepts images and PDF documents only.": ["Türkçe": "Order preview, logo ve avatar alanları görsel dosya kabul eder. Client Files yalnızca görsel ve PDF belgeleri kabul eder.", "English": "Order previews, logos and avatars accept image files. Client Files accepts images and PDF documents only."],
    "Maximum upload size": ["Türkçe": "Maksimum yükleme boyutu", "English": "Maximum upload size"],
    "These settings help protect your workspace when users upload images and client PDFs.": ["Türkçe": "Bu ayarlar, kullanıcılar görsel ve müşteri PDF dosyası yüklerken workspace’i korumaya yardımcı olur.", "English": "These settings help protect your workspace when users upload images and client PDFs."],
    "Users must only upload legal, safe and work-related files that belong in this workspace.": ["Türkçe": "Kullanıcılar yalnızca bu workspace’e ait, yasal, güvenli ve işle ilgili dosyalar yüklemelidir.", "English": "Users must only upload legal, safe and work-related files that belong in this workspace."],
    "If a file belongs to a client or third party, the user should have permission to use it for the order.": ["Türkçe": "Dosya bir müşteriye veya üçüncü tarafa aitse, kullanıcının bu dosyayı sipariş için kullanma izni olmalıdır.", "English": "If a file belongs to a client or third party, the user should have permission to use it for the order."],
    "Shared file is ready. Open the correct order and tap Add here.": ["Türkçe": "Paylaşılan dosya hazır. Doğru siparişi açıp Buraya ekle’ye basın.", "English": "Shared file is ready. Open the correct order and tap Add here."],
    "Please accept the Upload Policy before importing shared files.": ["Türkçe": "Paylaşılan dosyaları içeri aktarmadan önce Upload Policy onayını kabul edin.", "English": "Please accept the Upload Policy before importing shared files."],
    "Importing shared files...": ["Türkçe": "Paylaşılan dosyalar içeri aktarılıyor...", "English": "Importing shared files..."],
    "%d shared file(s) added to this order.": ["Türkçe": "%d paylaşılan dosya bu siparişe eklendi.", "English": "%d shared file(s) added to this order."],
    "No shared files were imported.": ["Türkçe": "Hiçbir paylaşılan dosya içeri aktarılmadı.", "English": "No shared files were imported."],
    "Shared files cleared.": ["Türkçe": "Paylaşılan dosyalar temizlendi.", "English": "Shared files cleared."],
    "%d shared file(s) waiting": ["Türkçe": "%d paylaşılan dosya bekliyor", "English": "%d shared file(s) waiting"],
    "Add these shared files to this order, or clear them.": ["Türkçe": "Bu paylaşılan dosyaları bu siparişe ekleyin veya temizleyin.", "English": "Add these shared files to this order, or clear them."],
    "Add here": ["Türkçe": "Buraya ekle", "English": "Add here"],
